flowchart TD
    D1[Alarm / wake-up] --> D2{Awake before approx 8:00-8:30?}
    D2 -->|Yes| D3{Decide: walk to mess?}
    D2 -->|No, groggy/late| D4{Roommate/friend actively prompts?}
    D4 -->|Yes, prompted| D3
    D4 -->|No prompt| D6[Stays in room - no action taken]
    D3 -->|Goes| D5[Walks to mess, joins counter queue]
    D3 -->|Doesn't go| D6
    D5 --> D7{Registered item still available?}
    D7 -->|Yes| D8[Served, eats]
    D7 -->|Ran out| D9[Takes substitute item, or eats partial/leaves]
    D6 --> EX[See Exception paths]
    D8 --> BILL
    D9 --> BILL
    EX --> BILL
    BILL[Billed by registration count, regardless of what happened above]
